OL,3,GNEWSAThe bridge that brings an entire
OL,4,Atown to a halt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest closure came on Friday after
OL,7,Fa fatal incident, with the disruption
OL,8,Ftrending on social media and becoming
OL,9,Fone of the most searched topics in the
OL,10,FUK on Google. So how does one bridge
OL,11,Fhave such an impact and how do you fix
OL,12,Fit?
